manifest recipe: pre_install compiles the single-file clinfo.c (via the
upstream Makefile, VPATH=src) against the Khronos headers, then manifest
copies bin/clinfo + man1/clinfo.1 into the package tree.

Build details:
- CPPFLAGS=-I$goboIndex/include so <CL/cl.h> resolves (OpenCL-Headers
  recipe must be installed first; build.sh chains OpenCL-Headers -> Clinfo).
- CFLAGS is passed explicitly to override the Makefile's `-Werror` (GCC 14
  -Wall/Wextra warnings would abort otherwise); the Makefile's `+=` still
  appends -std=c99 -Wall -Wextra.
- The Nvidia recipe ships libOpenCL.so.1 (ICD loader) but no unversioned
  libOpenCL.so dev symlink; pre_install creates one in the build dir and
  passes -L. so -lOpenCL links (link-time only, never packaged).
- Runtime: ICD loader dlopens libnvidia-opencl.so.1 via nvidia.icd; both
  live in /System/Index/lib on the ISO.
